{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set loversBecomingEx = ttm_get_lovers_becoming_ex(npc.UUID) %}
{% set datingPartner = ttm_get_dating_partner(npc.UUID) %}

Engagement is a serious, binding commitment that definitively leads to marriage — more formal than dating, the final step before marriage.
{% if loversBecomingEx != "" %}
NOTE: {{speakingNpc.name}} currently has lover(s): {{loversBecomingEx}}. Accepting this engagement proposal will end those lover arrangements — they will become ex-lovers.
{% endif %}
USE ONLY when somebody explicitly proposed engagement to {{speakingNpc.name}}.
{% if datingPartner != "" %}
NEVER accept an engagement proposal from anyone other than {{datingPartner}}.
{% endif %}
NEVER use for flirting, compliments, or any proposal not leading to marriage.
NEVER confuse with proposing a dating relationship (romantic, less formal) or lovers relationship (sexual, casual).

